#* {{quote-book|en|year=1660|author=w:William Petty|title=[[:s:Reflections upon Ireland (Petty 1660)/9#170|Reflections upon some Persons and Things in Ireland]]|page=170|column=1|passage=As for ''Religion'', I have not said, much lesse meant irreverently of it, or of the '''Professors''' thereof.}}
